{"id":26982,"author":"Alpp","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eApplication\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eAge:\u0026nbsp;12 and a half\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eTimezone: England\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you have access to TeamSpeak? Yes/No:\u0026nbsp;Yes\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you have access to Skype? Yes/No: Yes\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you have access to a recording software? Yes/No:\u0026nbsp;Yes\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eCRITERIA 1: SELF REFLECTION/EVALUATION\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you have any experience as a staff member on any servers? No\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eWhat is your biggest weakness and how do you believe it will affect your\r\nmoderating? I'm\u0026nbsp;not the best at pvp and that may cause people to\u0026nbsp;be salty against me.\u0026nbsp;What is your biggest strength and how would this affect your\r\nmoderating? My biggest strength is making people laugh, I think this will help as many people throughout the minecraft community\u0026nbsp;are becoming more depressed every day, this includes avicus. With my help, I may be able to cheer them up. I may be a 12 year old mineman but I can put people in to a good mood.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eHow do you believe you can help improve the Staff Team? I believe I can come up with new and exotic ideas to add to the server. Many of these ideas that I have come up with have been forwarded to mods on\u0026nbsp;teamspeak.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eWhat qualities does a leader need to have in your opinion? He/she needs to be a team player, needs to be kind, needs to be helpful and needs to be able to guide people in times of need. Do you\r\nconsider yourself to be a leader? Sometimes.\u0026nbsp;Why? This is because when I play scrims I help out teammates with plans which can help. Even if I die on a teams game on skywars, I would put all of my soul (literally) in to making sure that player wins by guiding them around the map with strategies.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from other players that qualify you\r\nto be a moderator? I can be thoughtful and put myself in to someone elses perspective and see from their point of view about what they think of a situation. Say for instance when passing on an idea which I think is worthy to be added to the server\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eWhat skills do you believe you should have when interacting with the\r\ncommunity? To always have a nice, presentable voice. If new comers come on to the teamspeak and hear you as a mod\u0026nbsp;be toxic/salty at another player, they will not\u0026nbsp;play the server as much as they would have.\u0026nbsp;Remember, first impressions matter.\u0026nbsp;Do you believe you have these skills? Yes I do, well mostly, not really on the pvp side of things\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eHow much time can you commit to being a staff member (Rough Idea)?\u0026nbsp;Usually about 6 hours at least a week, I can play for quite a bit on the weekend.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eCRITERIA 2: GENERAL SITUATIONS\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eYou are currently undergoing your junior moderator trial. A ban evader\r\nis online and he is constantly ban evading and hacking. You are the only one\r\nonline and the only one who is able to be online. What would you do? I should take note of his/hers past names to make sure he/she doesn't get unbanned and ip ban him/her\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eAnother staff member is constantly joining and harassing other people on\r\nTeamspeak in their team channel. The staff member is also referee and has\r\nphysical permissions to be in that channel. However the leaders do not want\r\nthis staff member in there and they have asked him to leave multiple times.\r\nWhat would you do? I would temporarily ban him from the teamspeak channel.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eA player appeals a punishment you gave them. You realise that the\r\nevidence file is corrupted and therefore there is no physical evidence. You\r\nknow however this person did indeed break the rules, what would you do? Bring some eye witnesses to say what they saw.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eYou are in an Avicus team. One of your teammates is also an Avicus Staff\r\nmember. One day in your team discord the team member/staff member posts a\r\nscreenshot of a thread that only staff members can see. The content in the\r\nscreenshot isn’t very important/confident but only staff members could see it\r\non the forums. If anything, what would you do? Take screen shots and send them to higher up staff members to deal with.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eOne day the Senior Staff team makes a decision you do not agree with.\r\nYou do not know all the details of the decision or the circumstances in which\r\nthey were made and you were simply told by another staff member. However you do\r\nnot like the decision based from what you know. What would you do? Privately message one of the seniors and give him my opinion on the matter.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eCRITERIA 3: OTHER\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eNOTE: This is a new criteria and these questions are less to do with\r\nright/wrong answer and more to do with us getting to know you. Please answer\r\nthese honestly. There is no right or wrong answer.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eWhat would getting moderator on Avicus mean to you? It would mean I would be able to bring forward ideas to the avicus server maybe ascending the player base.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eHow passionate are you about Avicus? Very passionate, I log on very frequently. What does Avicus mean to you? It means a lot, when I was banned in 2015 December it really hit the heart and I was very happy when I was finally unbanned.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you speak any other languages than English? I can speak a bit of French... bonjour?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you have anything else to add to your application? I have 2160 wins on skywars... Yeah, I just thought I might say that, I don't know Why Though xD\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eApplication\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eAge:\u0026nbsp;12 and a half\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eTimezone: England\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you have access to TeamSpeak? Yes/No:\u0026nbsp;Yes\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you have access to Skype? Yes/No: Yes\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you have access to a recording software? Yes/No:\u0026nbsp;Yes\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eCRITERIA 1: SELF REFLECTION/EVALUATION\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you have any experience as a staff member on any servers? No\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eWhat is your biggest weakness and how do you believe it will affect your\r\nmoderating? I'm\u0026nbsp;not the best at pvp and that may cause people to\u0026nbsp;be salty against me.\u0026nbsp;What is your biggest strength and how would this affect your\r\nmoderating? My biggest strength is making people laugh, I think this will help as many people throughout the minecraft community\u0026nbsp;are becoming more depressed every day, this includes avicus. With my help, I may be able to cheer them up. I may be a 12 year old mineman but I can put people in to a good mood.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eHow do you believe you can help improve the Staff Team? I believe I can come up with new and exotic ideas to add to the server. Many of these ideas that I have come up with have been forwarded to mods on\u0026nbsp;teamspeak.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eWhat qualities does a leader need to have in your opinion? He/she needs to be a team player, needs to be kind, needs to be helpful and needs to be able to guide people in times of need. Do you\r\nconsider yourself to be a leader? Sometimes.\u0026nbsp;Why? This is because when I play scrims I help out teammates with plans which can help. Even if I die on a teams game on skywars, I would put all of my soul (literally) in to making sure that player wins by guiding them around the map with strategies.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eWhat attributes distinguish yourself from other players that qualify you\r\nto be a moderator? I can be thoughtful and put myself in to someone elses perspective and see from their point of view about what they think of a situation. Say for instance when passing on an idea which I think is worthy to be added to the server\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eWhat skills do you believe you should have when interacting with the\r\ncommunity? To always have a nice, presentable voice. If new comers come on to the teamspeak and hear you as a mod\u0026nbsp;be toxic/salty at another player, they will not\u0026nbsp;play the server as much as they would have.\u0026nbsp;Remember, first impressions matter.\u0026nbsp;Do you believe you have these skills? Yes I do, well mostly, not really on the pvp side of things\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eHow much time can you commit to being a staff member (Rough Idea)?\u0026nbsp;Usually about 6 hours at least a week, I can play for quite a bit on the weekend.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eCRITERIA 2: GENERAL SITUATIONS\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eYou are currently undergoing your junior moderator trial. A ban evader\r\nis online and he is constantly ban evading and hacking. You are the only one\r\nonline and the only one who is able to be online. What would you do? I should take note of his/hers past names to make sure he/she doesn't get unbanned and ip ban him/her\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eAnother staff member is constantly joining and harassing other people on\r\nTeamspeak in their team channel. The staff member is also referee and has\r\nphysical permissions to be in that channel. However the leaders do not want\r\nthis staff member in there and they have asked him to leave multiple times.\r\nWhat would you do? I would temporarily ban him from the teamspeak channel.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eA player appeals a punishment you gave them. You realise that the\r\nevidence file is corrupted and therefore there is no physical evidence. You\r\nknow however this person did indeed break the rules, what would you do? Bring some eye witnesses to say what they saw.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eYou are in an Avicus team. One of your teammates is also an Avicus Staff\r\nmember. One day in your team discord the team member/staff member posts a\r\nscreenshot of a thread that only staff members can see. The content in the\r\nscreenshot isn’t very important/confident but only staff members could see it\r\non the forums. If anything, what would you do? Take screen shots and send them to higher up staff members to deal with.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eOne day the Senior Staff team makes a decision you do not agree with.\r\nYou do not know all the details of the decision or the circumstances in which\r\nthey were made and you were simply told by another staff member. However you do\r\nnot like the decision based from what you know. What would you do? Privately message one of the seniors and give him my opinion on the matter.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eCRITERIA 3: OTHER\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eNOTE: This is a new criteria and these questions are less to do with\r\nright/wrong answer and more to do with us getting to know you. Please answer\r\nthese honestly. There is no right or wrong answer.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eWhat would getting moderator on Avicus mean to you? It would mean I would be able to bring forward ideas to the avicus server maybe ascending the player base.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eHow passionate are you about Avicus? Very passionate, I log on very frequently. What does Avicus mean to you? It means a lot, when I was banned in 2015 December it really hit the heart and I was very happy when I was finally unbanned.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you speak any other languages than English? I can speak a bit of French... bonjour?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: normal;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;,serif; font-size: 12pt;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you have anything else to add to your application? I have 2160 wins on skywars... Yeah, I just thought I might say that, I don't know Why Though xD\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","created_at":1490479527,"title":"Staff Application","replies":[{"id":364232,"author":"Crazy_","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e[Reviewing]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;- Your application has been tagged reviewing and will remain like this until at least 3 other Senior Staff members read over your application and vote.\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700;\"\u003e[Reviewing]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;- Your application has been tagged reviewing and will remain like this until at least 3 other Senior Staff members read over your application and vote.\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1490670291},{"id":364395,"author":"Camemes","body":"\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-42d7851a-1e09-73c4-c9c5-64b67eb18030\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:2.057142857142857;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:9pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e[Denied] \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e- I am sorry to say your application has been denied.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:2.057142857142857;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:9pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e- Recent toxicity and overall behaviour.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eYou may not submit 